# Shell 脚本必须是 LF：CRLF 会让 Linux 上报 `bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M`
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# 二进制不要当文本处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.zip binary
